        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "id",
          "transaction",
          "at"
        ],
        "title": "StreamEvent",
        "description": "DEPARTURE: a create's metadata rides in `value`, as every other event's\npayload does. The contract spreads it over the event, where its `type`\n(\"file\"/\"folder\") is shadowed by the event's own `type` (\"create\") and the\nclient can no longer tell a file from a folder.\n\n`transaction` does the job the old `version` field did as well: it is the\nid of the transaction this event announces, which IS the new token for the\nproperty it changed. On an event for property P, set the value and set P's\ntoken to `transaction`."
      },
